Subject: Exclude Netty from the managed metrics-graphite dependency

amqp-client 5.27.0 and later declares Netty 4.2 for its opt-in Netty frame handler. The DHI build raises amqp-client to 5.37.0 on 1.1 (CVE-2026-106121, CVE-2026-106122), so without this exclusion the maven enforcer RequireUpperBoundDeps rule demands Netty 4.2 while TinkerPop and the Cassandra driver stay on the Netty 4.1 line. amqp-client is only used by the GraphiteRabbitMQ sender, whose default socket frame handler does not need Netty. This is the same exclusion upstream carries from 1.2.0, without its XML comment.

CVE: CVE-2026-106121
CVE: CVE-2026-106122
Origin: DHI-internal (backport of upstream metrics-graphite netty exclusion)
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/JanusGraph/janusgraph 3b8843ffc6c81cf0076bf00119f1ffe80b9cf234
Regenerate: `perl -0pi -e 's|(<artifactId>metrics-graphite</artifactId>\n(\s+)<version>\$\{metrics.version\}</version>\n)|$1$2<exclusions>\n$2    <exclusion>\n$2        <groupId>io.netty</groupId>\n$2        <artifactId>*</artifactId>\n$2    </exclusion>\n$2</exclusions>\n|' pom.xml`
Verify: test tests/janusgraph_test.go
Forwarded: not-needed (upstream carries the exclusion from 1.2.0)
Drop-When: upstream >= 1.2.0

--- a/pom.xml
+++ b/pom.xml
@@ -1037,6 +1037,12 @@
                 <groupId>io.dropwizard.metrics</groupId>
                 <artifactId>metrics-graphite</artifactId>
                 <version>${metrics.version}</version>
+                <exclusions>
+                    <exclusion>
+                        <groupId>io.netty</groupId>
+                        <artifactId>*</artifactId>
+                    </exclusion>
+                </exclusions>
             </dependency>
             <dependency>
                 <groupId>io.dropwizard.metrics</groupId>
